From: Till Schneidereit <till@tillschneidereit.net>
Subject: [PATCH] Build the ICU4X glue crates against a runtime data provider

The extracted glue crates call the ICU4X constructors that take the compiled-in
data provider, which links the full ICU4X data set into every binary. Give each
of them an entry point taking the provider that icu_provider_glue builds from a
postcard blob, and add icu_provider_glue itself, which holds that provider.
---
